          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barcodes and QR codes, documents and scans, receipts, cards, screens and labels: photos taken to keep a piece of information, often forgotten afterwards. Vision looks at them on this Mac; a photo showing a face is never suggested."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codes-barres et QR codes, documents et scans, tickets, cartes, écrans et étiquettes : des photos prises pour garder une information, souvent oubliées ensuite. Vision les examine sur ce Mac ; une photo où figure un visage n’est jamais proposée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
